---
import Motifs from './Motifs.astro';
---

<section class='about' id='about' aria-labelledby='about-title'>
  <Motifs name='seed' class='about-seed' />
  <div class='about-inner'>
    <div class='interlude' aria-label='引文'>
      <blockquote lang='en'>
        <p>
          “Perhaps hopelessness is the very soil that nourishes human hope; perhaps one could never find
          sense in life without first experiencing its absurdity.”
        </p>
        <footer>— Václav Havel</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class='about-content'>
      <header class='section-heading'>
        <h2 id='about-title'>01 / ABOUT</h2>
      </header>

      <div class='about-copy'>
        <p class='lead'>
          <span lang='en'>The Very Soil</span> 是美国动画评论家 Jen A. Blue 于 2015 年 3 月出版的《魔法少女小圆》批评研究。全书从电视动画出发，延伸至《和美☆魔法少女》《魔法少女织莉子》《The Different Story》三部外传漫画，并最终在《叛逆的物语》中收束。
        </p>
        <p>
          Jen A. Blue 的文字不断往返于作品内外：一个镜头、一句台词、一种画风的突然侵入，都可能与魔法少女题材、《浮士德》、佛教、戏剧传统或其他文化文本发生联系。她尤其关注符号如何在不同语境中改变意义，以及作品如何借用、拆解并重新组织既有的形式与传统。
        </p>
        <ul aria-label='本书采用的批评视角'>
          <li>文本精读</li>
          <li>后现代主义</li>
          <li>女性主义</li>
          <li>佛教</li>
          <li>纸芝居</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--book-pale);
    background: var(--book-black);
  }

  .about::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 16%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--madoka-pink) 15%, transparent), transparent 28%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 78%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--homura-violet) 18%, transparent), transparent 30%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 52% 105%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sayaka-blue) 9%, transparent), transparent 34%);
  }

  .about-inner {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 76rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10.5rem);
  }

  .interlude {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border-block: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.18);
  }

  blockquote {
    max-width: 54rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.78);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.5);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--madoka-pink);
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about-copy {
    max-width: 45rem;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.7);
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.55vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 2;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .about-copy .lead {
    color: var(--book-pale);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.85vw, 1.28rem);
  }

  .about-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.24);
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.78);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  li:nth-child(1) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--madoka-pink) 58%, transparent);
  }

  li:nth-child(2) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--homura-violet) 68%, transparent);
  }

  li:nth-child(3) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sayaka-blue) 68%, transparent);
  }

  li:nth-child(4) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mami-gold) 72%, transparent);
  }

  li:nth-child(5) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kyoko-red) 68%, transparent);
  }

  :global(.about-seed) {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    right: -2.5rem;
    bottom: -5rem;
    width: clamp(16rem, 32vw, 30rem);
    color: var(--homura-violet);
    opacity: 0.1;
    transform: rotate(12deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 35rem) {
    .about-inner {
      width: min(100% - 1.25rem, 76rem);
    }

    blockquote p {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
